{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33008","headline":"吴宫宴 · 曹邺","name":"吴宫宴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吴宫城阙高，龙凤遥相倚。\n四面铿鼓钟，中央列罗绮。\n春风时一来，兰麝闻数里。\n三度明月落，青娥醉不起。\n江头銕剑鸣，玉座成荒垒。\n适来歌舞处，未知身是鬼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33008.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33008","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}